              'Compare Top-Down DP (Memoization) with Bottom-Up DP (Tabulation) in terms of recursion stack overhead, cache efficiency, and state exploration.',
              'Explain how Longest Increasing Subsequence (LIS) is optimized from O(N²) DP to O(N log N) using Binary Search (Patience Sorting).',
              'In 0/1 Knapsack, why must the capacity loop run backwards from W down to weight[i] when optimizing space to a 1D array?',
              'How do you formulate the 2D DP recurrence relation for Longest Common Subsequence (LCS) and Edit Distance (Levenshtein Distance)?',
              'How do you optimize 2D grid DP problems (e.g., Unique Paths, Minimum Path Sum) from O(M * N) space to O(N) space?',
