              'What is the exact difference between Mocks, Stubs, Spies, Dummies, and Fakes (Test Doubles)?',
              'What is Test-Driven Development (TDD) and explain the Red-Green-Refactor cycle with a concrete kata example.',
              'A unit/integration test passes reliably on your local machine but fails randomly in the CI pipeline. How would you investigate and eliminate this test flakiness (shared state, timezone, race conditions)?',
              'Why is achieving 100% line coverage not a guarantee of bug-free software, and why is branch/condition coverage and boundary value testing more meaningful?',
              'How do you test database-dependent and external-API-dependent code without making live network calls (Testcontainers, Mockito, WireMock)?',
              'What are the FIRST principles of good unit tests (Fast, Independent, Repeatable, Self-validating, Timely)?',
              'How do you write deterministic unit tests for time-sensitive code (timers, expirations, cache TTLs) using mock clocks?'
