              'What are Cache Penetration, Cache Breakdown (Thundering Herd), and Cache Avalanche, and how do you mitigate each using Bloom filters, mutex locks, and randomized TTL jitter?',
              'When should you choose a Relational Database (PostgreSQL) versus a NoSQL Document Database (MongoDB) versus an In-Memory Store (Redis)?',
              'How does Redis achieve single-threaded ultra-high throughput (epoll/kqueue I/O multiplexing, in-memory data structures, non-blocking event loop)?',
