              'How do you structure a secure, automated GitHub Actions CI/CD pipeline that runs linting, automated tests, builds container images, and publishes to a registry on pull request merge?',
              'What are Container Health Checks (Liveness Probe vs Readiness Probe vs Startup Probe) and how do orchestrators use them to prevent routing traffic to booting or crashed containers?',
              'How do you handle application secrets, database credentials, and environment configurations securely without baking them into Docker images or committing them to Git?',
