              "Explain the difference between a NumPy array view and a copy. Which operations (slicing vs boolean masking vs reshape vs flatten vs ravel) trigger copies, and what are the memory implications?",
              "Why is iterating over a Pandas DataFrame with .iterrows() or .apply() significantly slower than vectorized NumPy operations, and how does memory layout (C-contiguous vs Fortran-contiguous) impact cache locality?",
              "How does Pandas handle missing values (NaN vs None vs pd.NA), and how do missing values affect integer and boolean column type casting (e.g. Int64 nullable types)?",
