              "What is the difference between Data Drift (covariate shift), Concept Drift, and Prior Probability Shift? How do statistical tests (KS-Test, PSI) detect them in production?",
              "How does DVC (Data Version Control) integrate with Git and S3/GCS to ensure deterministic data and model artifact reproducibility without checking massive datasets into Git?",
              "Describe an automated model deployment pipeline: What automated smoke tests, shadow deployments, or canary rollouts must pass before promoting a model in the MLflow Model Registry?",
