              'When should you choose an interface versus a type alias in backend architecture, and how does interface declaration merging work?',
              'Why is unknown preferred over any for untrusted network inputs, and how do custom Type Predicates (value is T) enable safe runtime type narrowing?',
              'How do Discriminated Unions and Exhaustive Type Checking (never type in default switch cases) eliminate runtime error branching bugs?',
              'How would you design a generic, type-safe API Response wrapper (ApiResponse<T>) supporting success data, paginated metadata, and typed error details?',
              'Explain built-in utility types essential for backend DTOs: Partial<T>, Required<T>, Readonly<T>, Pick<T, K>, Omit<T, K>, and ReturnType<T>.',
