                text: 'Authentication (verifying identity) vs Authorization (verifying permissions); Dual-Token Architecture: Short-lived Access Token (10-15m in memory/header) + Long-lived Refresh Token (7d in HttpOnly cookie + hashed in DB); Refresh Token Rotation; RBAC (Role-Based) & ABAC (Attribute-Based); BOLA/IDOR protection.',
