                text: 'Never store JWTs in localStorage (vulnerable to XSS extraction). Always store sensitive tokens in HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Strict cookies. Passwords must be hashed using adaptive, salted algorithms: Argon2id (recommended) or bcrypt with cost factor 12+ (never MD5, SHA-1, or plain SHA-256).',
