                text: 'Broken Object Level Authorization (BOLA/IDOR): Checking that a user is logged in, but forgetting to verify they own the record being accessed (e.g. GET /api/orders/:id must verify order.userId === req.user.id). Accepting "alg: none" in JWT verification; putting passwords or PII in JWT payloads.',
