                title: '5. Production Auth Lifecycle Flow',
                text: '1. POST /auth/login -> 2. Verify Argon2 hash -> 3. Issue 15m Access Token & 7d Refresh Token -> 4. Client includes Access Token in Authorization: Bearer header -> 5. On 401, client calls POST /auth/refresh with HttpOnly cookie -> 6. Server rotates refresh token in DB and returns new token pair.',
