              'How do you test authenticated API endpoints (JWT headers / session cookies) cleanly in Vitest/Supertest without repeating login requests in every test block?',
              'Why is testing negative paths (400 Bad Request, 401 Unauthorized, 403 Forbidden, 404 Not Found, 429 Too Many Requests) just as important as testing happy paths (200/201)?',
              'What is Code Coverage (Line, Branch, Function, Statement), and why can 100% test coverage still fail to catch critical production bugs?',
              'Scenario: A service depends on a third-party SMS Gateway (Twilio). How do you write unit tests for the notification service and integration tests for the controller without sending real SMS messages or incurring costs?',
              'Common Pitfalls: Tests mutating shared state in a persistent database causing flaky test order dependencies, over-mocking internal implementation details instead of testing observable behavior, and skipping edge-case tests (null, empty strings, boundary numbers).',
