              'Explain the trade-offs between a Monolithic Architecture and a Microservices Architecture. When should a growing startup transition from a modular monolith to distributed services?',
              'How do Content Delivery Networks (CDNs) and Edge Caching work? How does Cache-Control with stale-while-revalidate reduce backend server load for static and dynamic assets?',
              'How do you scale a relational database (PostgreSQL) when write and read traffic increases? Discuss vertical scaling, read replicas, connection pooling with pgBouncer, and sharding.',
              'Explain the CAP Theorem (Consistency, Availability, Partition Tolerance). Why can a distributed database only guarantee two of the three in the presence of network partitions?',
              'What is a Load Balancer? Compare Layer 4 (Transport / TCP) vs Layer 7 (Application / HTTP) load balancing and common algorithms (Round Robin, Least Connections, IP Hash).',
              'How do you design an asynchronous Notification Service that sends push notifications, emails, and SMS alerts to millions of users without dropping messages or overloading downstream providers?',
