              'What is Tableau\'s Order of Operations (Filters pipeline: Extract -> Data Source -> Context -> Dimension -> Measure -> Table Calc)?',
              'What is the difference between Blue (Discrete) and Green (Continuous) pills in Tableau, and how do they impact axis creation and headers?',
              'How do Table Calculations (WINDOW_AVG, RUNNING_SUM, RANK) differ from regular calculated fields and LOD expressions?',
