              "Explain the difference between a Hard Link and a Soft (Symbolic) Link in the Linux filesystem. What happens to each when the original file is deleted?",
              "Walk me through how you troubleshoot a Linux server that has 100% CPU utilization. Which commands (top, ps, vmstat, pidstat) do you use to isolate the offending thread?",
              "What is the difference between SIGTERM (kill -15) and SIGKILL (kill -9)? Why should orchestrators send SIGTERM first and allow a graceful shutdown period?",
              "Explain how Linux file permissions work (rwx = 755 vs 644). What do SUID, SGID, and the Sticky Bit (chmod 1777 on /tmp) accomplish?",
              "How does systemd manage service dependencies and restarts? Explain how to write a basic custom systemd service unit file with Restart=on-failure.",
              "How do you check and troubleshoot disk space exhaustion when df -h shows 100% full but du -sh / does not account for the missing gigabytes (unlinked open file descriptors)?",
