                "title": "RULE: Privacy Manifests (PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy)",
                "text": "Apple mandates declaring all API usages (UserDefaults, File timestamps, System boot time) and tracking domains inside PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy to prevent fingerprinting."
