              "Explain the root cause of SQL Injection (SQLi). Why does string concatenation of user input in SQL queries break syntax, and how do Parameterized Queries (Prepared Statements) permanently solve it?",
              "Compare Stored XSS, Reflected XSS, and DOM-based XSS. How does context-aware output encoding prevent malicious JavaScript from executing in victim browsers?",
              "What is Insecure Direct Object Reference (IDOR / Broken Object Level Authorization)? How do you prevent an attacker from modifying GET /api/invoice/100 to /api/invoice/101?",
              "What is Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF)? How do attackers abuse SSRF in cloud environments to steal AWS IAM credentials from the instance metadata service (169.254.169.254)?",
