                "title": "RULE: Password Storage Standard",
                "text": "Never store passwords with SHA-256 or MD5. Use Argon2id (Memory: 64MB, Iterations: 3, Parallelism: 4) or bcrypt (Work factor: 12) to resist GPU/ASIC parallel brute-forcing."
