              "Walk through the TLS 1.3 Handshake step-by-step. How does Ephemeral Diffie-Hellman (ECDHE) achieve 1-RTT connection speed while providing Perfect Forward Secrecy (PFS)?",
              "What is Perfect Forward Secrecy (PFS)? If an attacker steals a server's private RSA key today, why can't they decrypt historical traffic captured over past months when PFS is enabled?",
              "Explain the X.509 Certificate Chain of Trust. How does a client browser verify that a certificate issued to example.com is valid and untampered with?",
