                "title": "KEY DIFFERENCE: CRL vs OCSP vs OCSP Stapling",
                "text": "CRL: client downloads large revoked cert list (slow); OCSP: client queries CA in real-time per request (privacy leak); OCSP Stapling: server periodically queries CA and caches time-stamped proof with TLS handshake (fastest, private)."
