                "title": "SOC Analyst Incident Triage Playbook & Case Management Workflow Suite",
                "description": "Design and implement a realistic SOC operations workflow: configure simulated alert feeds (brute force, malware beaconing, privilege escalation), construct structured analyst runbooks for Tier 1 triage, implement escalation criteria matrices, document ticket artifacts, and measure Mean Time to Detect (MTTD) and Mean Time to Respond (MTTR).",
