                "description": "Deploy and configure a centralized SIEM pipeline in a virtual lab: install Elastic Security or Splunk, deploy Filebeat log shippers on Linux and Windows endpoints, normalize authentication and web server logs, write custom SPL/KQL correlation rules, and build an interactive security operations dashboard.",
